Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:04:00.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.17,0:03:19.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a lot to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.36,0:04:05.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你袭击了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.43,0:04:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分明是跟我们作对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes things pretty clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.48,0:04:10.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你还不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to make things clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.85,0:04:13.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本可以把你们全杀光  但我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have killed you all. I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.32,0:04:17.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在总算见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:23.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我准备卸下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna remove my weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.96,0:04:25.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以表明我谈判的诚意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show that I mean to negotiate in good faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.93,0:04:28.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你也如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like you to do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:57.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随你便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's already in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.85,0:05:39.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在和瑞克谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sat down with Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.18,0:05:45.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没看见有车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see any cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.84,0:05:47.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉不太对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It don't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:49.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别熄火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it running.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:56.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.39,0:06:17.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么名堂  你们的人怎么早就进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell? Why's your boy already in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.97,0:06:20.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他到了吗  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's here? - Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么情况  \N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.94,0:06:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:37.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的朋友没诚意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend isn't much for small talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.10,0:06:40.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想谈  那就快谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to talk, talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.99,0:06:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我想让你们谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted you to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经有太多人白白丧命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many people have died for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:48.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须做个了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要无谓争斗  浪费子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the bullets for the real threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.60,0:06:53.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能改变现状\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can solve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:56.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才找你们来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I asked you to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.31,0:06:59.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你的那些勾当\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:03.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,袭击他人  人头鱼缸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard about the raids, the heads,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.43,0:07:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还有玛姬  -那是莫尔做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggie. - Merle did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.60,0:07:08.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你知道我说的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.26,0:07:10.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你了解我  我也了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know all about me and I know all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.95,0:07:12.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些都无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care about any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.92,0:07:15.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关键是向前看\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.26,0:07:33.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许我该进去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总督希望和瑞克单独谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Governor thought it best if he and Rick spoke privately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:39.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.21,0:07:41.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米尔顿·马梅特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milton Mamet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.63,0:07:45.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错嘛  还带着管家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. He brought his butler.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.74,0:07:47.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是他的顾问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm his advisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顾哪门子的问\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.73,0:07:52.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做计划  研究行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Planning. Biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you know, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:56.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没必要向别人马仔解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't feel like I need to explain myself to the henchmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:58.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小子  说话注意点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better watch your mouth, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:07:59.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们一整天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you and I are gonna be out here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:01.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都要端着枪  守在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}pointing guns at each other all day,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.63,0:08:05.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行行好吧  闭上臭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}do me a favor, shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:09.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要动粗  如果里面出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need this. If all goes south in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.75,0:08:12.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也得拼个你死我活\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll be at each other's throats soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:31.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.15,0:08:36.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把这些藏到装卸区  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stash these at the loading dock. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.58,0:08:38.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝丝  通道那再多放一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth, put more up on the catwalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有人被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone gets pinned down,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.84,0:08:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得确保他们有足够弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to make sure that they have plenty of ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.57,0:08:45.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去外面的牢笼守着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go work on the cage outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:49.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该做的是开上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we should be doing is loading some of this firepower
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:52.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装上武器  拜访总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a truck and paying a visit to the Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:54.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道他现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know where he is right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.45,0:08:56.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的意思是我们直接进去杀了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you suggesting that we just go in and kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.29,0:08:58.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.45,0:09:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们告诉瑞克和达里尔我们会待在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}We told Rick and Daryl that we'd stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.40,0:09:03.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我改主意了  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've changed my mind, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:06.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我弟弟自己出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being on the sideline with my brother out there
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:08.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我却待在这里无所事事\N{\fnArial\fs30}ain't sitting right with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.49,0:09:10.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们三个正在那里谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}The three of them are right in the middle of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:11.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我们的到来毫无准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea we're coming. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.59,0:09:13.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能会被扣为人质或者杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could get taken hostage or killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.98,0:09:15.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后果不堪设想\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thousand things could go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.53,0:09:17.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不去他们也会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.99,0:09:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸能照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad can take care of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.40,0:09:23.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  孩子  但是你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, son, but your dad's head
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:25.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没准一会就人头分家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}could be on a pike real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.55,0:09:30.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别对他说那种话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say that to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.16,0:09:37.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个办法行不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the right move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.13,0:09:39.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起码现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:42.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能让他们置身交叉火力之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't take the risk of putting them in the crossfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.99,0:09:45.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已下决定  不要再说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my decision. It's final.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.66,0:09:51.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在不同的时间认识了你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've known you both at different times,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.33,0:09:53.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但都是在这个世界变得一团混乱之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}but only after the world went to shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:55.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个都冒着很大的人身危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you both stepped up for the good of others
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.58,0:09:57.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为他人造福\N{\fnArial\fs30}at great personal risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.12,0:09:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没有理由...  -有话直说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no reason-- - Get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.45,0:10:02.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,河西归伍德伯里所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woodbury takes west of the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.23,0:10:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,河东归监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prison takes east.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.01,0:10:08.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,互不干扰  互不交涉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one crosses, no one trades.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.89,0:10:10.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.18,0:10:12.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该划清边界线  互不相扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should hammer out boundaries, then leave each other--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.35,0:10:15.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不好意思  这是什么  -解决方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry, what is this? - It's a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:19.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我来这做什么  你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell am I doing here? You told me--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.01,0:10:21.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你告诉他什么  -你告诉我他想协商\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Told him what? - You told me he was willing to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.13,0:10:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  但是事实上  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am, but the truth is, Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:27.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事可不是她说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's in no position to make such an offer anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.19,0:10:30.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天来只为了一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for one thing only--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.41,0:10:32.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}your surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.49,0:10:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要投降  放马过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you want surrender? Come get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:36.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们上次打得伍德伯里还不够惨吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think we hit Woodbury heavy last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.57,0:10:39.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别着急好吗  我们是来解决问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take it easy, all right? We're here to settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  你出去一下好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. Would you step outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.24,0:10:43.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:45.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和瑞克有很多话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick and I, we got a lot to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:48.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不会出去的  -我是来和他谈判的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not leaving. - I came to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're the Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是他们的叫法  不是我自己起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's-- that's their term, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:44.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But still,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.59,0:11:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是要对你的人负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're beholden to your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-当然了  -你对他们有责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, of course. - You have responsibility to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:55.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔不是你的副手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't Merle your lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.79,0:11:57.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他对我们很有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was helpful, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.22,0:12:00.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你知道他很暴戾\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you knew he was erratic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:02.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怪他不该\N{\fnArial\fs30}You blame him 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.69,0:12:04.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绑走格伦和玛姬吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}for scooping up Glenn and Maggie in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.31,0:12:06.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  当你袭击我们的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. I was trying to sort it out
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.81,0:12:08.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正想解决此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以是他的错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it was his fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很不好管  但是他办事效率高\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a wild card, but he's effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:17.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他能做好脏活\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gets the dirty jobs done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.45,0:12:21.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你会承担这个责任呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd take responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.64,0:12:27.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你是个警察  不是善辩的律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were a cop, not a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:32.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样  我不会去扮什么总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, I don't pretend to be a governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:36.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过  我是他们的领导者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I'm their leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.85,0:12:38.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是个推倒我的栅栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the town drunk
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.93,0:12:42.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毁坏我院子的混账\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knocked over my fence and ripped up my yard,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.19,0:12:44.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.33,0:12:50.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你曾经看错过人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you ever misjudge someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.81,0:12:57.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚跟我说了你的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea told me about your baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.41,0:13:02.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能是你搭档的种\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it might be your partner's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.91,0:13:07.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你愿抚养她  我很钦佩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're caring for her and I admire that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.72,0:13:10.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你缺乏洞察力的见证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Restitution for your own lack of insight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:15.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有看清你身边的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}For failing to see the devil beside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.05,0:13:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能看清谁是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I see him, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.50,0:13:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带了威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.24,0:13:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有理由不利用一下现在的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no reason not to use this time we have together
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:13:59.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来谈谈我们的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}to explore the issues ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.35,0:14:00.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大说坐下把嘴闭上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss said to sit tight and shut up. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.80,0:14:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么不叫总督大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you mean the Governor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.55,0:14:05.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们坐下谈是件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good thing they're sitting down,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.71,0:14:07.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是在不幸发生后\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially after what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:10.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会解决的  没人想再发动战争了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna work it out. Nobody wants another battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:12.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会管这个叫战争的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't exactly call it a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:15.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会的  我刚叫完\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would call it a battle and I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.20,0:14:17.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还记录下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recorded it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.65,0:14:18.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.71,0:14:21.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总要有人记录下来我们所经历的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's got to keep a record of what we've gone through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:23.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会成为历史的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be a part of our history.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.34,0:14:25.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.45,0:14:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我采访了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got dozens of interviews--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先请\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.20,0:14:54.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没门  你先\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娘炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what he's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:16:00.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢抽薄荷醇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I prefer menthols.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.48,0:16:03.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傻帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Douchebag.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.40,0:16:12.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是军人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You army or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:14.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I just--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:16.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恨这些行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}just hate these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.31,0:16:20.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们伤害了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what they did to 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.01,0:16:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妻子和孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}my wife, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.05,0:16:27.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:30.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.46,0:16:40.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不过是逢场作戏  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.63,0:16:42.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们什么都解决不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They ain't gonna work anything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.44,0:16:43.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  他们会做做样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, they'll do their little dance
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.87,0:16:46.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后明天  后天\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tomorrow, next day...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.20,0:16:50.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就会下令开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll give the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:07.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,介意我问问你是怎么失去一条腿的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask how you lost your leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.47,0:17:09.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:12.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了防止感染扩散\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you cut off your leg
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.91,0:17:15.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你砍下了自己被咬的那条腿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep the infection from spreading?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.29,0:17:17.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.62,0:17:20.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在被咬后的多长时间内砍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long after the initial bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.76,0:17:22.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:23.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有失血过多吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't bleed out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.71,0:17:26.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时有一些懂医术的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.22,0:17:27.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们悉心照料我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.91,0:17:29.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是医生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctors?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:31.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们靠实践摸索出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We learned by trial and error.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:36.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能看一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.70,0:17:45.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的假肢  我想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your stump. I'd like to, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:48.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想看一下你采取的截肢术是怎样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}ahem, see where the amputation was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.51,0:17:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离被咬的伤口有多远的距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}How high above the bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:52.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不给你看我的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not showing you my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:54.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一项重要的数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's important data.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:17:57.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才刚刚认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.18,0:17:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你至少得先给我买杯酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least buy me a drink first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:16.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我关心我的同伴们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I care about my people
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.93,0:18:18.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没有轻视他们的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't take their deaths lightly,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.39,0:18:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你和我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know you don't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:22.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在某种程度上  这场战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a way, this fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.71,0:18:24.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们领导的败笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a failure of leadership.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.28,0:18:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就别骚扰我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在停手  那就是更大的失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now, that would be an even bigger failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.16,0:18:32.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你进驻我们的后院\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've moved into our backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.95,0:18:35.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们的街道上扫射\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shot up Main Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.71,0:18:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我对这威胁置之不理  会显得我很弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I let that threat persist, I look weak
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.90,0:18:40.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后  领导结构就会崩塌\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, well, the whole thing crumbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.18,0:18:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的问题  你的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's your problem. Your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.13,0:18:45.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不正是我们来此的目的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, isn't that why we're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.18,0:18:48.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作出选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.78,0:18:55.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们选择毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we choose to destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:18:59.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切过去奋斗的成果都将幻灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything we've fought for over the past year...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.52,0:19:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会害死我们认识的所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna kill everyone we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:10.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,监狱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}At your prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.11,0:19:12.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伍德伯里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in Woodbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.75,0:19:17.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们所爱的人  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}People we love, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.27,0:19:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一天  我正在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was at work one day
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:34.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听一个岁数只有我一半大的上司讲鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking shit from a boss half my age
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.76,0:19:36.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小子的智商堪忧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and an IQ even lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:39.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后电话响了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the phone rang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妻子出了意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife had been in an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.73,0:19:47.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"抱歉  布莱克先生  我们已竭尽所能了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sorry, Mr. Blake, we did everything we could."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.32,0:19:53.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就呆呆地坐在那里  手握电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sat there holding that phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:57.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心里清楚我再也见不到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing that I would never see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:02.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.26,0:20:07.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是场意外  不是谁的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just an accident. No one's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.85,0:20:12.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她给我留了封语音邮件让我回电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had left a voice-mail asking me to call her,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.97,0:20:15.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我当时没有机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I hadn't had a chance yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.07,0:20:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我坐在那儿  拿着电话想...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sat there clutching that phone thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.27,0:20:21.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"她想干什么"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What did she want?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,报个平安吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to check in?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.49,0:20:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我顺道买晚饭吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask me to pick something up for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.27,0:20:46.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她到底想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.51,0:21:54.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不准离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.93,0:21:57.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.23,0:22:01.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不能让你走  -你拦不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't let you. - You can't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.68,0:22:03.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要想和我们住一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna live here with us, 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.14,0:22:04.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就要守我们的规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's gonna be on our terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.75,0:22:07.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果米琼恩能做到  你怎么就不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Michonne can do it, why can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.49,0:22:11.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为外面那是我弟弟  这就是原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause it's my brother out there, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.47,0:22:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们到底发什么病啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter with y'all?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.51,0:22:19.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你置他们于危险中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let you put them in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.74,0:22:22.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点种吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nut up already, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.93,0:22:25.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人渣吃你女人的豆腐\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy cops a feel of your woman
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.75,0:22:28.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你就这样认怂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you pussy out like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.75,0:22:30.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别挡我的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.53,0:22:31.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.83,0:22:36.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.51,0:22:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.39,0:22:45.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.15,0:22:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我  放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.35,0:23:06.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失陪一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.67,0:23:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在那边怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.72,0:23:32.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们排挤我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They kicked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.22,0:23:38.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道自己在这儿干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what I'm doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.68,0:23:41.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是想帮忙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.36,0:23:47.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened with Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.45,0:23:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a sick man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.89,0:24:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.85,0:24:09.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.27,0:24:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是一家人  你应该和我们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're family. You belong with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.36,0:24:18.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果你回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you join us,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.65,0:24:20.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不能反悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.31,0:24:23.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.70,0:24:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实  我一点也不想当老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the truth is I didn't want any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.53,0:24:49.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们选择了我  因为没有更好的人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}They chose me because there was nobody else around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.84,0:24:54.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们仍然认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they still think that I'm the man
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.17,0:24:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是能保证他们安全的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that can keep them safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.58,0:24:58.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们仍然认为我知道自己在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}They still think I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.49,0:25:09.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们枪不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you got guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.66,0:25:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那天带回来不少家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. That was quite a stash you brought back the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.20,0:25:19.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的人不像你的人有丰富的作战经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, my people, they're not combat-tested like yours are,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.87,0:25:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我的手下人数众多\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I've got more of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.74,0:25:27.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这场战斗会一直继续  直到一方俱灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this fight, it will go down to the last man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.11,0:25:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做个了结吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.81,0:25:35.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.12,0:25:39.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.46,0:25:41.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以停止战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.06,0:25:49.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have something
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.46,0:25:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某件东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.62,0:25:57.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件东西能让所有不快烟消云散\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing that makes this all all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.66,0:26:00.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会把监狱拱手相让\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not giving up the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.56,0:26:02.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.63,0:26:04.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I--
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.83,0:26:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想要你的监狱  那里不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want your prison. That doesn't sound safe at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.31,0:26:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在那里失去了你妻子  同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you lost your wife, another man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.14,0:26:12.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.27,0:26:14.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那对我来说更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}What good would that do me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.21,0:26:17.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚好我能用独眼监视你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best you stay where I can keep my one good eye on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.63,0:26:37.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.87,0:26:40.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交她出来  既往不咎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn her over and this all goes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.33,0:26:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很超值吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.81,0:26:50.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.28,0:26:56.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换一监狱的人命\N{\fnArial\fs30}worth all those lives at your prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.12,0:27:01.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.57,0:27:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.48,0:27:25.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The folks here,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.61,0:27:28.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们很坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.62,0:27:29.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}good fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.78,0:27:34.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们不会杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they ain't killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.62,0:27:36.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克杀过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.92,0:27:39.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬杀过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.03,0:27:40.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔杀了自己母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl put down his own mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.66,0:27:42.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那叫解脱痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mercy killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.16,0:27:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟杀人可不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That don't make him an assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.79,0:27:45.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm, but you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.13,0:27:48.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不得已时我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.64,0:27:50.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你怎么解释没杀掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how do you explain letting me get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.84,0:27:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定是被你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have been seduced
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.04,0:27:56.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人格魅力迷惑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}by your sterling personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.62,0:28:00.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟不跟我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming with me or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.79,0:28:04.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和我弟弟  我们打猎时有一些暗号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and my brother, we have a few calls we use when we hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.29,0:28:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会提前告知他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give him a heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.52,0:28:08.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他能提醒自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll warn the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.46,0:28:10.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去把总督斩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shogun the Governor's ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.83,0:28:12.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我解决其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.43,0:28:15.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一眨眼就能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be home before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.30,0:28:17.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about Andrea?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.94,0:28:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,子弹横飞时  她必须迅速做出选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullets fly, she's gonna have to make her choice real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.08,0:28:27.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是自己去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.14,0:28:30.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁被害死  都是你的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get people killed, it's on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.34,0:29:01.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为轮我值班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.99,0:29:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.62,0:29:09.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陪陪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep you company?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.34,0:29:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我差点没被掐死\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a hell of a choke hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.81,0:29:32.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该直接干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have put him to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.38,0:29:43.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们从伍德伯里回来后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we got back from Woodbury...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.49,0:29:47.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我光顾着自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made it all about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.96,0:29:51.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要空间  我却咄咄逼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you needed your space and I didn't give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.13,0:29:53.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之间不需要空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't need my space from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.17,0:29:58.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just... wanted you to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.37,0:30:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就在你眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.78,0:30:09.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我伴你左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm always with you, 
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.68,0:30:12.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我永伴你左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.29,0:30:17.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.12,0:30:19.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.22,0:30:21.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对不起  -我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.10,0:30:28.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱死你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.37,0:30:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.45,0:30:50.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-等一下  -怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.29,0:30:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.23,0:31:05.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  到这边来  来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Come here. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.99,0:31:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-哎呦  -我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}<i>' 0w!</i>
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.07,0:32:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我搞不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.00,0:32:15.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很明显  你胸怀大志\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've obviously got big plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.84,0:32:20.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就像是那种不计前嫌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you're the guy who's gonna lick this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.08,0:32:25.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拯救我们于危难之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring us back from the brink.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.02,0:32:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何把时间浪费在这样微不足道的仇杀上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why waste your time on a two-bit vendetta?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.52,0:32:32.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何冒这么大风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why risk it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.19,0:32:34.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们甚至愿意在小镇广场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have a statue of yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.33,0:32:37.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为你树立雕像  总督大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the town square, Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.30,0:32:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing Michonne
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.54,0:32:47.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不太像你会做的事  你不这么认为吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is sort of beneath you, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.60,0:32:50.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能救你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could save your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.61,0:32:54.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还能救你的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.08,0:32:58.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有你认识的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.19,0:33:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选择权在你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.10,0:33:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我把米琼恩交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I give you Michonne,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.47,0:33:25.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么知道你不会食言\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do I know you'll keep your word
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.41,0:33:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就此善罢甘休呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you'll stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.52,0:33:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以得到你需要的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have everything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.09,0:33:40.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对你说过  我不在乎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I don't care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.60,0:33:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你考虑考虑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.67,0:33:53.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两天时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.30,0:33:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正午时分来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be here at noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.55,0:36:08.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.69,0:36:13.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那家农资店四周埋伏好枪手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Position gunmen all around that feed store.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.12,0:36:15.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦你见到米琼恩  马上开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}The minute you see Michonne, you open fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.29,0:36:17.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留她活口  把其他人都干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the others, but you keep her alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.13,0:36:21.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那定的协议呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.27,0:36:24.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  莫尔的弟弟都会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they'll bring Rick, Merle's brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.57,0:36:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许还有格伦和莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe Glenn, Merle himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.40,0:36:28.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能把这帮人都干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can take care of the whole crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.57,0:36:30.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是避免发生屠杀的最佳方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the best way to avoid a slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.24,0:36:34.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这本身就是屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.35,0:36:41.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我们来说不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at our end.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.22,0:36:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们早晚得灭了瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to eliminate Rick sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.29,0:36:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比邻共存是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way we can all live side by side.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.31,0:37:01.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你组织了这次谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for setting that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.87,0:37:03.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的是不辞辛苦啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really put yourself out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.88,0:37:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很开心能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad I could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.78,0:37:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和瑞克定了条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick and I set terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.22,0:37:11.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他回去考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna consider them
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.75,0:37:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两天后我们再见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we'll meet again in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.65,0:37:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么样的条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}What sort of terms?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.13,0:37:25.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能谈妥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope it works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.05,0:37:47.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和总督会面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I met this Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.22,0:37:53.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟他谈了好一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sat with him for quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.83,0:37:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就你们两个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the two of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.86,0:37:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.36,0:37:59.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说我们该去吧  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should have gone when we had the chance, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.47,0:38:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想要监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.31,0:38:13.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想要我们消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants us gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.38,0:38:15.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.95,0:38:18.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想我们死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants us dead
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.75,0:38:21.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们毁了伍德伯里\N{\fnArial\fs30}for what we did to Woodbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.67,0:38:35.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要开战了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to war.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.42,0:39:31.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家的反应是预料之中的镇定啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The group's taking it as well as can be expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.59,0:39:33.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔和米琼恩认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle and Michonne are convinced
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.11,0:39:34.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该先发制人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should hit first.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.66,0:39:38.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和卡萝尔认为我们应该逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol and I think we should take our chances on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.91,0:39:41.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可咱们是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.30,0:39:43.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  如果大家要留下战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if we stay and fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.46,0:39:46.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.55,0:40:00.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他给了我另一个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave me a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.15,0:40:04.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一条生路\N{\fnArial\fs30}A way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.46,0:40:07.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有什么条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.84,0:40:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.17,0:40:16.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会杀掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.57,0:40:20.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后会照样杀掉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then kill us anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.34,0:40:27.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一他不这么做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if he doesn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.85,0:40:30.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一他真的放我们走呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if this is the answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.49,0:40:38.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.86,0:40:43.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.00,0:40:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感到害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.93,0:40:51.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们确实害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.34,0:40:53.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.44,0:40:56.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有害怕他们才会接受这条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause that's the only way they'll accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.85,0:41:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她救过我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.58,0:41:07.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也救过卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Carl's.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.19,0:41:09.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格兰  玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, Maggie--
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.45,0:41:11.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果她没过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}if she hadn't come here,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.29,0:41:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们根本不会知道他们被抓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we never would have known they were taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.63,0:41:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她赢得了一席之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's earned her place.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.13,0:41:17.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.70,0:41:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she has.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.18,0:41:34.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意牺牲自己女儿来保护她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you willing to sacrifice your daughters' lives for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.25,0:41:44.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.92,0:41:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.46,0:41:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你能劝我别那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hoping you can talk me out of it.
